ction 'QA Consulting Income Alpha' (category Consulting) showed the Category select reset to 'Select category' while Type/Date/Description/Amount/Reference/Notes/Tax were pre-filled correctly. Editing only description, amount and the tax toggle and saving produced a record with a BLANK category: 'Aug 27, 2026 | QA Consulting Income Alpha EDITED | (blank) | QA-REF-001 | +$450.75'. Description, amount and tax status themselves updated correctly, and delete works (verified separately), but the update silently loses data the user never changed.\", \"evidence\": \"Re-editing and explicitly re-selecting Consulting restored the category, confirming the cause is the missing pre-fill.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created 'QA Test Category' (type Income, color Violet) — appeared under Income categories; edited to 'QA Renamed Category' with Rose color — name and swatch color both updated; deleted via confirmation dialog — removed from the list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Type=Expense offered only expense categories (Office Supplies..Insurance); switching to Income offered only Sales Revenue, Consulting, Interest Income, Other Income. Selected 'Consulting' was retained on the saved transaction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created with Tax Related ON → row showed TAX '✓'. Edited with toggle OFF → TAX column blank. Edited again with toggle ON → TAX '✓' restored.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search 'client' + Type=Income + Category=Consulting + 2024-11-01..2024-12-31 returned exactly 2 rows, both satisfying all criteria. Clearing all criteria restored the full 19-row set with totals +$47,913.00 / -$36,485.99.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": 